# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HARD RULE: no Compustat-derived content in git, ever. The build writes here;
# none of it is ever committed. Only code, configs, and file hashes live in the
# repo -- every Compustat-derived artifact (the regularization statistics, the
# coverage mask and its row index, the canonical per-column statistics) is
# published from the gated Hugging Face repositories instead, because this tree
# is Apache-2.0 and the WRDS licence is non-commercial. See NOTICE.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
results/
*.parquet
*.csv
*.npy

# ...except the tiny SYNTHETIC example artifacts, which are safe to commit.
!examples/*.parquet

# ...and the pinned canonical id maps (account/industry embedding orderings):
# derived entirely from the in-repo task config and FF48 table -- item names and
# integer ids, no WRDS data of any kind. Deliberately NOT a bare `reference/*.csv`:
# the firm map is vintage-dependent WRDS-derived membership and must never be
# committed, so only the two data-independent maps are un-ignored.
!src/proforma20q/reference/account_id_map__*.csv
!src/proforma20q/reference/industry_id_map__*.csv

# WRDS credentials must never be committed.
.pgpass
*.pgpass

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
